  "description": "Beautiful two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment in the heart of the IFSC, offering bright interiors, a south-facing balcony and excellent transport links.\n\nA superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom first-floor apartment ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin's highly sought-after IFSC. Bright and spacious throughout, this attractive apartment offers generous accommodation, a sunny south-facing balcony and access to beautifully maintained communal gardens, making it an excellent choice for convenient city living.\n\nDesigned with modern living in mind, the accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room with access to the south-facing balcony, and a well-appointed kitchen offering excellent storage and workspace. There are two generous double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a main bathroom. The property is further enhanced by gas-fired central heating, lift access and a Virgin Media point. A designated car parking space is also available, if required, at an additional monthly cost.\n\nThe property enjoys an exceptionally convenient location in the heart of Dublin's financial district, with an excellent range of amenities right on the doorstep. Residents benefit from an abundance of cafés, restaurants, bars, gyms and leisure facilities, together with the Gibson Hotel, Spencer Hotel and National College of Ireland nearby. Mayor Square LUAS stop is located at the entrance to the development, providing excellent connectivity across the city, while the Samuel Beckett Bridge offers easy pedestrian access to Grand Canal Dock and the wider Docklands area. Some of Dublin's largest employers are also based within the surrounding business district, making this an exceptionally well-connected location for city living.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Two double bedrooms\n\n• Two bathrooms, including master en-suite\n\n• Bright and spacious first-floor apartment\n\n• South-facing balcony with sunny aspect\n\n• Attractive communal gardens\n\n• Designated car parking space available separately at an additional monthly cost\n\n• Excellent central IFSC location\n\n• Mayor Square LUAS stop on the doorstep\n\n• Gas-fired central heating\n\n• Lift access\n\n• Virgin Media point\n\n• Excellent range of amenities within walking distance",
